  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "Given equation: 289 * 121 * 154 * 307 * (34 * 3) * 2\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) ÷, -, +, -, ×, =\n\nGiven: 289 * 121 * 154 * 307 * (34 * 3) * 2\n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get;\n\n⇒ 289 ÷ 121 - 154 + 307 - (__**34 × 3**__) = 2\n\n⇒ __**289 ÷ 121**__ - 154 + 307 - 102 = 2\n\n⇒ __**2.38**__ - 154 __**+ 307**__ - 102 = 2\n\n⇒ __309.38 - 154 - 102__ = 2\n\n⇒ 53.38 ≠ 2\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 2) ×, +, -, =, +, ÷\n\nGiven: 289",
